<title>USA: AccuStaff acquires Training Delivery.</title>
<headline>AccuStaff acquires Training Delivery.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuStaff Inc said Tuesday it acquired privately-held Training Delivery Services Inc, a supplier of technical and professional service employees to the telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed, but AccuStaff said Training Delivery had revenues of over $40 million in 1996. It said the transaction was expected to be accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>AccuStaff provides business services, including consulting, outsourcing, training, and strategic staffing services, with over 900 branch, franchise, and associated offices in 45 states, the District of Columbia and Canada.</p>
</text>
